e other victims of the regime. There\u2019s no fighting the system here, no chance to topple it \u2014 you\u2019ve already lost. Your only goal is simple: <strong>survive</strong>! Who will you team up with? Who can you trust? And how do you avoid being the last one left behind? Tension runs high until only <strong>one</strong> remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/1a732a9cc995f56d8308743416fc6d30.poster.avif?t=1756809948\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/1a732a9cc995f56d8308743416fc6d30.webm?t=1756809948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/1a732a9cc995f56d8308743416fc6d30.mp4?t=1756809948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VARIETY OF GAMES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round brings a new challenge, with more games added through updates. Enjoy a wide range of experiences with your friends \u2014 each designed to be unforgettable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/0080e2d1e23e0256e82ba8d7227ff4fa.poster.avif?t=1756809948\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/0080e2d1e23e0256e82ba8d7227ff4fa.webm?t=1756809948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/0080e2d1e23e0256e82ba8d7227ff4fa.mp4?t=1756809948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOOD LUCK!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory takes more than logic or persuasion \u2014 sometimes, you\u2019ll have to put your faith in pure luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/0b77672d4ff589374fe7d4db01138b9c.poster.avif?t=1756809948\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/0b77672d4ff589374fe7d4db01138b9c.webm?t=1756809948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/0b77672d4ff589374fe7d4db01138b9c.mp4?t=1756809948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DICTATORSHIP!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where life is scored, and your fate can be decided by the spin of a wheel, one question remains: what are you willing to do to survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/ac1b528e6ecb87b7d5e48683f1938a06.poster.avif?t=1756809948\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/ac1b528e6ecb87b7d5e48683f1938a06.webm?t=1756809948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/ac1b528e6ecb87b7d5e48683f1938a06.mp4?t=1756809948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Morty's Develop"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea